OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and the odd shower possible
OL,7,FFriday. Dry and bright Saturday, rain
OL,8,Flater. Cloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,9,FSunday, drier later. Temperatures
OL,10,Ftrending a little above average.
